# Pairs with BornImpliesSplit. Sibling birth resets the donor's split phase.
MODULE: BirthBeforeSplit
TARGET: BornImpliesSplit
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a persisted sibling has no split protocol owning it
PERTURBS: Birth

--- FIND
Birth ==
    /\ phase = "splitting"
    /\ ~born
    /\ born' = TRUE
    /\ siblingPrev' = TRUE
    /\ phase' = "splitting"
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: birth outside a split.
Birth ==
    /\ phase = "splitting"
    /\ ~born
    /\ born' = TRUE
    /\ siblingPrev' = TRUE
    /\ phase' = "idle"
--- END
